#: upses.php
msgid "The Name you would like to give this UPS.  For APCUPSD and NUT Devices, a corresponding Cacti Device will be created automatically for the UPS using this name.  For SNMP based UPS's, you must create the Cacti Device first."
msgstr "Aha ị ga-achọ inye UPS a. Maka Ngwaọrụ APCUPSD na NUT, a ga-emepụta Ngwaọrụ Cacti kwekọrọ na ya na akpaaka maka UPS ahụ site na iji aha a. Maka UPS ndị dabere na SNMP, ị ga-ebu ụzọ mepụta Ngwaọrụ Cacti."

#: upses.php
msgid "New UPS"
msgstr "UPS Ọhụrụ"

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Description"
msgstr "Nkọwa UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "A more detailed Description of this UPS if required."
msgstr "Nkọwa zuru ezu karị maka UPS a ma ọ bụrụ na achọrọ ya."

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Type"
msgstr "Ụdị UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Type of UPS you are monitoring."
msgstr "Ụdị UPS ị na-enyocha."

#: upses.php
msgid "Poller ID"
msgstr "ID Poller"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller that this UPS exists in is monitored by"
msgstr "Poller nke na-enyocha UPS a dị na ya"

#: upses.php
msgid "Site Name"
msgstr "Aha Saịtị"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Site that this UPS exists in."
msgstr "Saịtị ebe UPS a dị."

#: upses.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Ọ dịghị"

#: upses.php
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Ebe Ọ Dị"

#: upses.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Ebe nkịtị Ngwaọrụ ahụ dị. Ederede a nwere ike ịbụ ọnụ ụlọ, ebe rakị dị, na ihe ndị ọzọ."

#: upses.php
msgid "Cacti Device"
msgstr "Ngwaọrụ Cacti"

#: upses.php
msgid "For SNMP Based UPS', select the Cacti Device to use for SNMP credentials.  Otherwise, select None, and the UPS plugin will create the Device for you automatically."
msgstr "Maka UPS ndị dabere na SNMP, họrọ Ngwaọrụ Cacti ị ga-eji maka nzere SNMP. Ma ọ bụghị ya, họrọ Ọ dịghị, mgbe ahụ ngwa mgbakwunye UPS ga-emepụtara gị Ngwaọrụ ahụ na akpaaka."

#: upses.php
msgid "Autocreate on First Poll"
msgstr "Mepụta na Akpaaka na Nnyocha Mbụ"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Akwadoro"

#: upses.php
msgid "Check to immediately start polling for data."
msgstr "Tụnye akara ka i bido nnyocha data ozugbo."

#: upses.php
msgid "APC UPSD Information"
msgstr "Ozi APC UPSD"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname of the host running apcupsd or the NUT server (upsd)."
msgstr "Aha nnabata nke kọmputa nnabata na-agba apcupsd ma ọ bụ sava NUT (upsd)."

#: upses.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Ọdụ TCP"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enter the TCP Port for this UPS.  apcupsd defaults to 3551 and NUT defaults to 3493."
msgstr "Tinye Ọdụ TCP maka UPS a. apcupsd na-eji 3551 na ndabara ma NUT na-eji 3493 na ndabara."

#: upses.php
msgid "Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Oge Njedebe (sekọnd)"

#: upses.php
msgid "How long the poller waits for apcupsd or the NUT server before giving up on this UPS, from 1 to 120 seconds.  SNMP based UPS's use the SNMP timeout instead."
msgstr "Ogologo oge poller na-echere apcupsd ma ọ bụ sava NUT tupu ọ hapụ UPS a, site na sekọnd 1 ruo 120. UPS ndị dabere na SNMP na-eji oge njedebe SNMP kama."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Options"
msgstr "Nhọrọ NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT UPS Name"
msgstr "Aha UPS nke NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The name of the UPS on the NUT server, as listed by \"upsc -l\" (the part before the @ in ups@host).  One NUT server can serve several UPSes."
msgstr "Aha UPS dị na sava NUT, dị ka \"upsc -l\" depụtara ya (akụkụ dị tupu @ na ups@host). Otu sava NUT nwere ike ijere ọtụtụ UPS ozi."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Username"
msgstr "Aha Njirimara NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The upsd.users account to authenticate with.  Leave blank for anonymous read-only access, which is how NUT servers are usually monitored."
msgstr "Nhọrọ. Akaụntụ upsd.users iji mee nkwenye. Hapụ ya ka oghere maka nnweta ọgụgụ naanị na-amaghị aha, nke bụ otu a na-esikarị enyocha sava NUT."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Password"
msgstr "Okwuntụghe NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The password for the NUT Username."
msgstr "Okwuntụghe maka Aha Njirimara NUT."

#: upses.php
msgid "Use TLS (STARTTLS)"
msgstr "Jiri TLS (STARTTLS)"

#: upses.php
msgid "Encrypt the connection with STARTTLS before any credentials are sent.  The NUT server certificate and host name are verified, so the certificate must be trusted by the Cacti poller, or you can point to its CA / certificate file below."
msgstr "Zoo njikọ ahụ na koodu site na STARTTLS tupu e zipụ nzere ọ bụla. A na-enyocha asambodo sava NUT na aha nnabata, yabụ poller Cacti ga-atụkwasịrịrị asambodo ahụ obi, ma ọ bụ ị nwere ike ịtụ aka na faịlụ CA / asambodo ya n'okpuru."

#: upses.php
msgid "CA / Certificate File"
msgstr "Faịlụ CA / Asambodo"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The full path on the Cacti poller to a PEM file holding the CA certificate (or the self-signed server certificate) to verify the NUT server against, for example /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  The host name above must match the certificate."
msgstr "Nhọrọ. Ụzọ zuru ezu dị na poller Cacti gaa na faịlụ PEM nke ji asambodo CA (ma ọ bụ asambodo sava nke onye ji aka ya binye) iji nyochaa sava NUT, dịka ọmụmaatụ /etc/nut/upsd.pem. Aha nnabata dị n'elu ga-adakọrịrị na asambodo ahụ."

#: upses.php
msgid "Allow Self-Signed Certificate"
msgstr "Kwe Ka Asambodo Nke Onye Ji Aka Ya Binye"

#: upses.php
msgid "Accept any certificate without checking it.  The connection is still encrypted, but the NUT server is not authenticated, so a man-in-the-middle could read the NUT credentials.  Prefer the CA / Certificate File above."
msgstr "Nabata asambodo ọ bụla n'enyochaaghị ya. A ka na-ezo njikọ ahụ na koodu, mana anaghị ekwenye sava NUT, yabụ onye nọ n'etiti nwere ike ịgụ nzere NUT. Họrọ Faịlụ CA / Asambodo dị n'elu kama."

#: upses.php
msgid "SNMP Options"
msgstr "Nhọrọ SNMP"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname where the snmp agent is located."
msgstr "Aha nnabata ebe onye nnọchi anya snmp dị."

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller ID cannot be changed while the UPS is linked to a Cacti Device.  Change the poller on the device instead."
msgstr "Enweghị ike ịgbanwe ID Poller mgbe UPS jikọtara na Ngwaọrụ Cacti. Gbanwee poller dị na ngwaọrụ ahụ kama."

